      "content": "hey can u help me write a formal letter to my landlord in berlin? my radiator heating element is broken and it's getting really cold so i need to request a repair ASAP. i need it to sound professional and assertive so they actually take it seriously. i'm living in a rental apartment and i need to make sure i'm following the right formal tone for a hausverwaltung.",
